---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Paddle Weight Guide — Light vs Mid vs Heavy | PaddleFitHub"
  description="Understand pickleball paddle weight ranges: light (7.0-7.5 oz), mid (7.5-8.0 oz), and heavy (8.0-8.5 oz). Which is right for you?"
  canonicalPath="/blog/paddle-weight-guide/"
>
  <div class="container-narrow py-16">
    <p class="text-caption-mono text-mute uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Resource</p>
    <h1 class="text-display-xl text-ink mb-4">Paddle Weight Guide</h1>
    <p class="text-body-lg text-body mb-8">Paddle weight is one of the most important factors in how your paddle feels and performs. Here is what you need to know.</p>

    <div class="prose text-body-md text-body space-y-6 max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Weight categories</h2>
      <p>Most pickleball paddles fall into three weight ranges:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Light (7.0 – 7.5 oz):</strong> Fastest hand speed, least fatigue, but less power and stability on off-center hits.</li>
        <li><strong>Mid-weight (7.5 – 8.0 oz):</strong> Best balance of power and control. The most popular range for intermediate to advanced players.</li>
        <li><strong>Heavy (8.0 – 8.5 oz):</strong> Maximum power and stability, but slower to maneuver and more fatiguing over long sessions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">How weight affects your game</h2>
      <p>Heavier paddles generate more power from mass alone, requiring less swing effort. Lighter paddles give you quicker reactions at the net but may lack punch on groundstrokes. Mid-weight is the safest starting point.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Factors to consider</h2>
      <p>Your play style, arm health, session length, and experience level all affect the ideal weight. Use the <a href="/tools/paddle-weight-advisor/">Paddle Weight Advisor</a> for a personalized recommendation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline">
      <a href="/tools/paddle-weight-advisor/" class="btn-primary">Try the Paddle Weight Advisor</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>